# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries
*.exe
*.exe~
gamelist
gamelist-debug
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Go test binary + coverage output
*.test
*.out

# Go workspace files
go.work
go.work.sum

# Environment / secrets
.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER commit these:
#   configs/config.yaml holds your personal IGDB/Steam/Epic API credentials.
#   The SQLite database also stores validated tokens.
# A fresh clone auto-generates a default config.yaml on first run.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
configs/config.yaml

# SQLite database files
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal

# Local Go build/module cache (created by the dev tooling)
.gocache/

# Build output
build/
dist/

# Editor / OS junk
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini